    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "46e680d8c572e9cd",
      "translationZh": "方法概述",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "626847028f92913b",
      "translationZh": "那么，诀窍是什么？对于潜在一致性蒸馏，每个模型都需要单独进行蒸馏。LCM LoRA 的核心思路是只训练少量适配器，也就是 LoRA 层，而不是训练整个模型。得到的 LoRA 随后就可以应用于该模型的任何微调版本，无需再对这些版本单独进行蒸馏。如果你已经迫不及待地想看看实际效果，可以直接跳到下一节，动手试试推理代码。如果你想训练自己的 LoRA，可以采用以下流程：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "413dd155038acfd6",
      "translationZh": "从 Hub 中选择一个可用的教师模型。例如，你可以使用 SDXL (base)，也可以使用任何你喜欢的微调版本或经过 DreamBooth 训练的版本。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "007adad2b43d8b1f",
      "translationZh": "基于该模型训练一个 LCM LoRA。LoRA 是一种性能高效微调方法，即 PEFT，其成本远低于全模型微调。有关 PEFT 的更多细节，请参阅这篇博文或 diffusers LoRA 文档。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6ea526338527ae68",
      "translationZh": "将这个 LoRA 与任意 SDXL 扩散模型及 LCM 调度器配合使用；大功告成！只需几步，你就能获得高质量的推理结果。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "48e813b406f331b0",
      "translationZh": "有关该流程的更多细节，请下载我们的论文。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "896b3fc7f7d4808b",
      "translationZh": "这为什么重要？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f33d216d0feca32a",
      "translationZh": "Stable Diffusion 和 SDXL 的快速推理带来了新的用例和工作流程。下面列举几个：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a5b05c017f834dd1",
      "translationZh": "可及性：即使无法使用最新的硬件，也有更多人能够有效地使用生成式工具。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ac1d3dc542b37bb6",
      "translationZh": "更快的迭代：只需花费原来一小部分的时间，就能获得更多图像及多种变体！无论用于个人还是商业用途，这对艺术家和研究人员来说都非常棒。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "631d5fe5cd2ec473",
      "translationZh": "生产环境工作负载有望在不同的加速器上运行，包括 CPU。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f65cb09e12a740ba",
      "translationZh": "更便宜的图像生成服务。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "41d951f418d11962",
      "translationZh": "为了直观了解我们所说的速度差异，在 M1 Mac 上使用 SDXL（基础版）生成一张 1024x1024 图像大约需要一分钟。使用 LCM LoRA 后，我们只需约 6 秒（4 步）就能获得出色的结果。这快了一个数量级，而无需等待结果更是带来了颠覆性的改变。使用 4090 时，我们几乎能获得即时响应（不到 1 秒）。这使得 SDXL 可以用于要求实时事件响应的应用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "66bb97fb3eb9f163",
      "translationZh": "使用 SDXL LCM LoRAs 实现快速推理",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e88bf036994d67f6",
      "translationZh": "今天发布的 diffusers 版本让使用 LCM LoRAs 变得非常简单：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e243f0b84ae6c99f",
      "translationZh": "请注意这段代码是如何完成以下操作的：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7f1fff235f145f67",
      "translationZh": "使用 SDXL 1.0 基础模型实例化一个标准扩散流水线。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f776f4fdbe977c82",
      "translationZh": "应用 LCM LoRA。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2802aa48cf7bafee",
      "translationZh": "将调度器更改为 LCMScheduler，也就是潜在一致性模型所使用的调度器。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "eeb84cf3eb03cb0d",
      "translationZh": "就这么简单！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "727bf4b7afb0965f",
      "translationZh": "这样就会生成下面这张全分辨率图像：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "24815407f1dc747b",
      "translationZh": "使用 SDXL 和 LCM LoRA，通过 4 步生成的图像。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "979b2932ad59765d",
      "translationZh": "质量对比",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e96480bf2505b149",
      "translationZh": "我们来看看步数如何影响生成质量。以下代码将生成总推理步数为 1 到 8 步的图像：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "74aeee70e73ef007",
      "translationZh": "以下是以网格形式展示的 8 张图像：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0d7d48bd942d9546",
      "translationZh": "LCM LoRA 以 1 到 8 步生成的图像。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b827e0c5e0aab90a",
      "translationZh": "正如预期的那样，只用 1 步只能生成大致的形状，没有可辨识的特征，也缺乏纹理。不过，结果会迅速改善，通常只需 4 到 6 步就能达到非常令人满意的效果。就个人口味而言，我觉得上一次测试中用 8 步生成的图像饱和度有点太高，也有点过于“卡通化”，因此在这个例子中，我可能会从 5 步和 6 步生成的图像中挑选。生成速度非常快，你可以只用 4 步就创建一批不同的变体，然后选出喜欢的图像，再根据需要增加几步并细化提示词，继续迭代。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "c452f34e36b0e7fa",
      "translationZh": "引导强度与负面提示词",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "24f894f344efb875",
      "translationZh": "请注意，在前面的示例中，我们将 guidance_scale 设为 1，这实际上相当于禁用了引导。这对大多数提示词都有效，而且速度最快，但会忽略负面提示词。你也可以尝试将引导强度设在 1 到 2 之间，以使用负面提示词——我们发现，更大的值不起作用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "4ab78deecbb3dc3f",
      "translationZh": "与基础版 SDXL 的质量对比",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "612daccdb6a208ac",
      "translationZh": "在质量方面，这与标准 SDXL 流水线相比如何？我们来看一个例子！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "17fcce8640cd7a50",
      "translationZh": "通过卸载 LoRA 权重并切换到默认调度器，我们可以快速将流水线恢复为标准 SDXL 流水线：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6610a0c1461b5cdc",
      "translationZh": "然后，我们就可以像往常一样运行 SDXL 推理。我们将使用不同的步数来收集结果：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "401a0c88ad72f2d0",
      "translationZh": "SDXL 流水线的结果（使用相同的提示词和随机种子），步数分别为 1、4、8、15、20、25、30 和 50。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "46cea3baca9ca53b",
      "translationZh": "如你所见，在这个例子中，不到约 20 步（第二行），生成的图像基本上都没法用，而随着步数增加，质量仍在明显提升。最终图像的细节令人惊叹，但达到这样的效果用了 50 步。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "5abe0f84209015aa",
      "translationZh": "将 LCM LoRA 用于其他模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0055",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "17996782cbd309e9",
      "translationZh": "这项技术也适用于任何其他经过微调的 SDXL 或 Stable Diffusion 模型。为了演示这一点，我们来看看如何使用 collage-diffusion 进行推理，这是一个使用 Dreambooth 从 Stable Diffusion v1.5 微调而来的模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0056",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7db3a558094d50b9",
      "translationZh": "代码与前面示例中看到的类似。我们先加载经过微调的模型，然后加载适用于 Stable Diffusion v1.5 的 LCM LoRA。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0057",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dd2f975873358eb4",
      "translationZh": "将 LCM LoRA 技术与 Dreambooth Stable Diffusion v1.5 模型结合，实现 4 步推理。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0058",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "2f3b3281a407d818",
      "translationZh": "全面集成 Diffusers",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0059",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ea2ac8bf85341bb4",
      "translationZh": "在 diffusers 中集成 LCM 后，就可以利用 diffusers 工具箱中的诸多功能和工作流。例如：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0060",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "88b37c53f787b1fb",
      "translationZh": "为搭载 Apple Silicon 的 Mac 提供开箱即用的 mps 支持。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0061",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3377a30b9aefed1e",
      "translationZh": "内存和性能优化，例如 flash attention 或 torch.compile()。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0062",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "75c89fbb4e0cd7d9",
      "translationZh": "针对低内存环境的额外内存节省策略，包括模型卸载。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0063",
      "kind": "list-item",
