    {
      "id": "b0095",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1a1a45a6617efd4d",
      "translationZh": "latent-consistency/lcm-lora-sdxl。适用于 SDXL 1.0 基础模型的 LCM LoRA，如上面的示例所示。",
