    {
      "id": "b0101",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b158debea737d85e",
      "translationZh": "借助 diffusers + PEFT 集成，你可以将 LCM LoRAs 与常规 SDXL LoRAs 结合，赋予它们仅需 4 步即可运行 LCM 推理的超能力。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0102",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5236cfdd1bb3f9da",
      "translationZh": "这里，我们将把 CiroN2022/toy_face LoRA 与 LCM LoRA 结合：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0103",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f81e9170ca3ee40f",
      "translationZh": "将标准 LoRAs 与 LCM LoRAs 结合，实现快速（4 步）推理。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0104",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "edfbd3e13126f5cc",
      "translationZh": "想找些探索 LoRAs 的灵感？来看看我们的实验性 LoRA the Explorer (LCM version) Space，体验社区创作的精彩作品，获取灵感！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0105",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "3c783a736764361a",
      "translationZh": "如何训练 LCM 模型和 LoRAs",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0106",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4b6710f073b602d4",
      "translationZh": "作为今天 diffusers 发布内容的一部分，我们提供了与 LCM 团队作者合作开发的训练和微调脚本。这些脚本让用户能够：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0107",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2f90c68b30fc2ece",
      "translationZh": "在 Laion 等大型数据集上，对 Stable Diffusion 或 SDXL 模型进行全模型蒸馏。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0108",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "44caa01a20ef1898",
      "translationZh": "训练 LCM LoRAs，这个过程要容易得多。正如我们在本文中所展示的，它还让我们无需进行蒸馏训练，就能使用 Stable Diffusion 进行快速推理。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0109",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c05fb9bfe10b4abc",
      "translationZh": "更多详情，请查看代码仓库中针对 SDXL 或 Stable Diffusion 的说明。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0110",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1f557c438cfbaee5",
      "translationZh": "我们希望这些脚本能激励社区尝试自己的微调。如果您将它们用于自己的项目，请务必告诉我们！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
